<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 320 520" role="img" aria-labelledby="maintenance-dependencies-title maintenance-dependencies-description">
    <title id="maintenance-dependencies-title">Tables and settings for street maintenance</title>
    <desc id="maintenance-dependencies-description">The street-length metric supplies a lengths table and the condition metric supplies a conditions table. Those tables and the caller’s threshold feed the maintenance calculation, which returns a maintenance table. Connections show data requirements, not parallel execution.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="maintenance-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <g class="connections" marker-end="url(#maintenance-arrow)">
      <path d="M 222 50 H 302 V 370 H 222" />
      <path d="M 222 150 H 302" />
      <path d="M 222 250 H 302" />
      <path d="M 117 400 V 460" />
    </g>
    <g class="labels">
      <text x="260" y="40">table</text>
      <text x="260" y="140">table</text>
      <text x="260" y="240">setting</text>
      <text x="173" y="437">returns</text>
    </g>
    <g class="nodes">
      <rect x="12" y="20" width="210" height="60" rx="8" />
      <rect x="12" y="120" width="210" height="60" rx="8" />
      <rect x="12" y="220" width="210" height="60" rx="8" />
      <rect class="calculation" x="12" y="340" width="210" height="60" rx="8" />
      <rect x="12" y="460" width="210" height="48" rx="8" />
    </g>
    <g class="labels">
      <text x="117" y="46">Street lengths</text>
      <text class="detail" x="117" y="67">lengths</text>
      <text x="117" y="146">Condition scores</text>
      <text class="detail" x="117" y="167">conditions</text>
      <text x="117" y="246">Caller’s threshold</text>
      <text class="detail" x="117" y="267">default: 50</text>
      <text x="117" y="366">Calculate street</text>
      <text x="117" y="387">maintenance</text>
      <text x="117" y="490">Maintenance table</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>The maintenance calculation needs two tables and a threshold. Each producer can also supply its table to other reports.</figcaption>
</figure>

